# Boston's raw OSM is 240 MB — GitHub HARD-REJECTS any file over 100 MB, so
# unlike every other town's, it cannot be committed (43 MB gzipped would fit,
# but it would permanently double the repo alongside Boston's already-46 MB
# world.json, which DOES have to ship). Regenerate it with `npm run map:boston`;
# the built world.json is committed, so nothing about the game depends on it.
data/boston/raw/overpass.json
